Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:10:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] REPA: UI section and docs

Adds an opt-in "REPA" group to the Training card for the models that
support it (the additionalSections convention of train.audio_loss_multiplier):
a checkbox, the weight and the block index. Turning it on writes the whole
`repa` block so the advanced YAML shows every key; turning it off writes
`enabled: false`. Encoder, projector and encoder resolution stay in the
YAML. Switching to a model without REPA drops the block, since the trainer
refuses it there. A docs entry explains what it does and costs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
